[I] GLib/GObject client library for the snapd REST API

[T] snapd-glib is a library that lets GLib-based applications talk to snapd,
[T] the daemon that controls Snaps, over its REST API. It also provides a
[T] snapd-qt wrapper for Qt based applications.

[U] https://github.com/canonical/snapd-glib

[A] Robert Ancell <robert.ancell@canonical.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network

[L] LGPL
[V] 1.72

